{"unit_id":"tag:0ADF:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>本节是《下降（Descent）》的节<REF_0001>对于代数空间（algebraic spaces）的对应版本。本节的大多数论证都是形式的，仅依赖下降（descent）数据的定义。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADG:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），这些空间在<MATH_0003>上。<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0004>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>如下对象的下降数据（descent datum for）<MATH_0005><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0006>，其源和目标为<MATH_0007>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces），满足<TEXTITOPEN_0002>上闭链条件（cocycle condition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，即图（diagram）<MATH_0008>交换（commutes）（使用显然的记号）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 我们也称对<MATH_0009>是一个<TEXTITOPEN_0003>相对下降数据（descent datum relative），相对于<MATH_0010><TEXTITCLOSE_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 一个<TEXTITOPEN_0004>态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>（相对于<MATH_0012>的下降数据之间的（of descent data relative））<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>是一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>，其源和目标为<MATH_0014>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces），使得图（diagram）<MATH_0015>交换（commutes）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descent datum for","target_term":"如下对象的下降数据"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上闭链条件"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"descent datum relative","target_term":"相对下降数据"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"of descent data relative","target_term":"的下降数据之间的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term