{"unit_id":"tag:0ADH:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphism），其源和目标为<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。设<MATH_0004>是相对于<MATH_0005>的下降（descent）数据。我们可以将同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0006>看作一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0007>，其源和目标为<MATH_0008>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。因此，粗略地说，可以将<MATH_0009>看作一个映射（map）<MATH_0010><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>遗憾的是，我们在这里为箭头选取了“错误”的方向。在定义<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>中，我们应采用与定义<REF_0003>中相反的方向，这是因为“函数（functions）”与“空间（spaces）”对偶（dual）这一一般原则。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。于是，上闭链条件（cocycle condition）表示<MATH_0011>。这样，它与拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）上的下降（descent）数据情形十分相似。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"functions","target_term":"函数"},{"source_term":"spaces","target_term":"空间"},{"source_term":"dual","target_term":"对偶"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上闭链条件"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"functions","target_term":"函数","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"spaces","target_term":"空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"dual","target_term":"对偶","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上闭链条件","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent